  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairclinic-provider-production",
  "description": "Fairclinic Provider Production: dental production, adjustments and collections per provider and month: net production, collections as a percent of net, adjustments as a percent of gross, months well below a provider's others, and months missing from the export. Not a pay calculation or a judgment of anyone's clinical work.",
